# Scratch output, not fixtures. oracle_test.exs WRITES these on every run
# (File.write! at :125, :142, :158) to prove yelixer can decode its own
# encoding. They have never been tracked, and the name is the trap: they sit
# beside real committed fixtures and read as inputs.
# Ignored so a blanket `git add apps/yelixer/test` cannot sweep them in —
# which is exactly how they nearly landed on 2026-08-08.
yelixer_oracle_*.bin
